%% Phase1 / post / MV3-G01h 发送任务卡
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/visual/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/post/mv3-g01h/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/management-new/.../task-chat.component.ts::sendTaskCardById；src/pages/management-new/.../chat-view.component.ts::sendTaskCardById
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  participant Ext as Other business host
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员在任务详情抽屉或任务聊天视图点「发送到聊天」，任务以卡片形态出现在目标会话，接收者可直接看到任务标题与状态
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=partial；helix=none；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  UI->>Gate: sendMessage(payload)
  Gate-->>UI: 当前客户端路由结果或受控空结果
  Note over Gate,IM: 当前合同 helixCommand=NONE；Helix 不接管该 Gate，不能凭图补造 command、Effect 或业务事件
  alt 旧业务 Host 仍可用
    Ext->>Go: POST /posts/create（非 Helix 链路）
    Go-->>Ext: HTTP response / legacy result
    Ext-->>UI: 旧链路结果（不纳入 Helix Gate Event）
  else 当前入口隐藏、待定或断供
    Note over Ext,Go: 当前合同要求 fail-closed；不伪造成功消息、不新增 Helix fallback
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：发送成功后发送者侧 channel.unreadCount 绝对归零（== 0，不是递减）；频道内其它可见成员的 getMemberUnread(channelId, otherUserId).unreadCount 相比发送前恰好 +1（幂等累加）；该值必须各侧独立计算，禁止用发送者数值推导；message.readBits 长度 == channel.members.length，位序 == channel.members 顺序，发送者对应位 == '1'；接收者对应位在其调用 postRead 之前恒为 '0'，不得因发送者已读而被置 '1'
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：不得走上传链路；temporaryId 不得继续用 task-card-$Date.now()：同毫秒并发两次发送会碰撞，导致两条消息互相 merge 覆盖（helix 接入时必须换全局唯一 id）；success 到达时命中已有 temporaryId 不得裸替换消息对象，必须 mergePostIntoExisting（否则丢 sendStatus / uploadProgress / 高度缓存）
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：postReceived，POST，channelUpdateByPost，UPDATE_CHANNEL；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
